			"notes": "<b>Fixes</b>\n        <hr>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Fixed bug #3: Muti-Dimensional travel using private cameras is now available</li>\n          <li>Fixed bug #4: Now Cameras actually get deleted from server data</li>\n          <li>Fixed bug: Now you can view private cameras from diferent dimensions</li>\n          <li>Fixed bug: Alarm output sometimes couldn't be toggled</li>\n          <li>Fixed bug: Teleporting to a camera sometimes teleported you to the camera first and then the actual spawn location</li>\n        </ul>\n        <b>Changed</b>\n        <hr>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Added a temporary converter for private cameras that were created before the 1.4.1 update to make them work again</li>\n          <li>Added a temporary converter to fix issues when viewing private cameras from the computer</li>\n        </ul>"
		},
