			"notes": "<b>Blocks</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Computer</li>\n              <li>Added Alarm Block</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Items</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Video Cable</li>\n              <li>Added Night Vision Module</li>\n              <li>Added Entity Glowing Module</li>\n              <li>Added Alarm Module</li>\n              <li>Added Motion Detection Moduke</li>\n              <li>Added Player Detection Module</li>\n              <li>Added Redstone Module</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>GUIs</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Computer Register GUI</li>\n              <li>Added Computer Login GUI</li>\n              <li>Added Computer Management GUI</li>\n              <li>Added Alarm Settings GUI</li>\n              <li>Added Camera View Properties GUI</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Overlays</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Camera View Overlay</li>\n              <li>Added Night Vision Filter Overlay</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Keybinds</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Exit Camera View: LSHIFT</li>\n              <li>Added Camera Turn Left: A</li>\n              <li>Added Camera Turn Right: D</li>\n              <li>Added Camera Turn Up: W</li>\n              <li>Added Camera Turn Down: S</li>\n              <li>Added Camera Properties: I</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Commands</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added get armed_alarm_cameras parameter to the /cameras command.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Recipes</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Added Computer Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Video Cable Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Night Vision Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Entity Glowing Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Alarm Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Motion Detection Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Player Detection Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Redstone Module Recipe</li>\n              <li>Added Alarm Block Recipe</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Chnages</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Changed all GUIs to not include a \"Done\" button, but instead have a check mark icon.</li>\n              <li>All GUI's title is a floating windows</li>\n              <li>Welcome message doesn't show \"Important\"</li>\n            </ul>\n            <b>Fixes</b>\n            <hr>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Fixed bug: You could make a pixelator camera store items using the hopper, so as any other block that doesn't include a slot GUI.</li>\n              <li>Fixed bug: Could click the pixelator screen before the GUI has opened.</li>\n            </ul>"
		},
